<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>&lt;script&gt;alert(&#39;x&#39;)&lt;/script&gt; &amp; &quot;q&quot; · Kilau</title></head>
<body>
<h1>&lt;script&gt;alert(&#39;x&#39;)&lt;/script&gt; &amp; &quot;q&quot;</h1>
<p>&lt;script&gt;alert(&#39;x&#39;)&lt;/script&gt; &amp; &quot;q&quot;</p>
<p><a href="/posts/7/edit">Edit</a></p>
<form method="post" action="/posts/7"><input type="hidden" name="_method" value="delete"><button>Delete</button></form>
<p><a href="/posts">All posts</a></p>

</body>
</html>
ok show escapes the title in <title> and <h1>
ok show escapes the content
ok show never holds the raw script
ok the list escapes each title
ok edit escapes the input value
ok edit posts to the post with a patch override
<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>New post · Kilau</title></head>
<body>
<h1>New post</h1>
<form method="post" action="/posts">
<ul class="errors">
<li>title minimal 2 karakter</li>
<li>content wajib diisi</li>
</ul>
<p><label>Title <input name="post[title]" value="&lt;"></label></p>
<p><label>Content <textarea name="post[content]"></textarea></label></p>
<button>Save</button>
</form>

</body>
</html>
ok errors are listed, escaped
ok the typed value survives, escaped
ok a valid form lists no errors
